{"id": "ru-fd6958211b4a.ru", "jokeId": "ru-fd6958211b4a", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Source words kept; 'сказал бригадир' trimmed because the screen shows who speaks. The nailing is the payoff, so the narrator closes with it. The 'corpse' is the officer in a dark suit without his cap; mourners are a crowd pushed away. No coffin yet, requested.", "title": "Контрольное захоронение", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["paren", "barmen", "sluzhivy"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "barmen": "craftsman", "sluzhivy": "police-officer"}, "scenes": [{"location": "ulitsa", "place": "cemetery", "cast": ["paren", "barmen", "sluzhivy"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "barmen": "craftsman", "sluzhivy": "police-officer"}, "looks": {"sluzhivy": {"remove": ["police-cap"], "add": ["tie"], "clothes": "#2b2b30"}}, "crowd": {"who": "people", "size": "few"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy", "to": "center"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "sluzhivy", "item": "money", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "crowd", "react": "flee"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "barmen", "item": "wrench", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}]}], "needs": [{"kind": "prop", "id": "coffin", "description": "an open wooden coffin with a lid, a man can lie in it", "why": "the officer poses as a corpse in a coffin and the punchline is nailing its lid shut"}], "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "На кладбище во время похорон бригадир гробовщиков видит, что у покойника из нагрудного кармана пиджака торчит пятидесятирублёвая купюра.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Он тут же просит одного из своей бригады под любым предлогом оттеснить людей от гроба.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Когда это было сделано, и он потянулся к купюре, покойник вдруг хватает его за руку и кричит:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Налоговая полиция! Контрольное захоронение!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4, "laugh": "chuckle"}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "У тебя своя работа, а у меня своя.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "И забил в крышку гроба гвозди.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-fd6958211b4a.en", "jokeId": "ru-fd6958211b4a", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; fifty roubles became a fifty-dollar bill, the cry follows adaptNote. The nailing is the payoff, so the narrator closes with it. Coffin requested.", "title": "The Sting Burial", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["paren", "barmen", "sluzhivy"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "barmen": "craftsman", "sluzhivy": "police-officer"}, "scenes": [{"location": "ulitsa", "place": "cemetery", "cast": ["paren", "barmen", "sluzhivy"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "barmen": "craftsman", "sluzhivy": "police-officer"}, "looks": {"sluzhivy": {"remove": ["police-cap"], "add": ["tie"], "clothes": "#2b2b30"}}, "crowd": {"who": "people", "size": "few"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy", "to": "center"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "sluzhivy", "item": "money", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "crowd", "react": "flee"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "barmen", "item": "wrench", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}]}], "needs": [{"kind": "prop", "id": "coffin", "description": "an open wooden coffin with a lid, a man can lie in it", "why": "the officer poses as a corpse in a coffin and the punchline is nailing its lid shut"}], "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "At a cemetery, during a funeral, the foreman of the gravediggers sees a fifty-dollar bill sticking out of the breast pocket of the dead man's jacket.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "He immediately asks one of his crew to push the people away from the coffin on any pretext.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "When that's done and he reaches for the bill, the dead man suddenly grabs his hand and shouts:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Tax police! Sting burial!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4, "laugh": "chuckle"}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "You've got your job, and I've got mine.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "And he nailed the coffin lid shut.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-fd6958211b4a.de", "jokeId": "ru-fd6958211b4a", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; fifty roubles became a fifty-euro note, the cry follows adaptNote. The nailing is the payoff, so the narrator closes with it. Coffin requested.", "title": "Die Testbeerdigung", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["paren", "barmen", "sluzhivy"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "barmen": "craftsman", "sluzhivy": "police-officer"}, "scenes": [{"location": "ulitsa", "place": "cemetery", "cast": ["paren", "barmen", "sluzhivy"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "barmen": "craftsman", "sluzhivy": "police-officer"}, "looks": {"sluzhivy": {"remove": ["police-cap"], "add": ["tie"], "clothes": "#2b2b30"}}, "crowd": {"who": "people", "size": "few"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "sluzhivy", "to": "center"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "sluzhivy", "item": "money", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "crowd", "react": "flee"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "barmen", "item": "wrench", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}]}], "needs": [{"kind": "prop", "id": "coffin", "description": "an open wooden coffin with a lid, a man can lie in it", "why": "the officer poses as a corpse in a coffin and the punchline is nailing its lid shut"}], "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Auf dem Friedhof, während einer Beerdigung, sieht der Vorarbeiter der Totengräber, dass aus der Brusttasche vom Jackett des Toten ein Fünfzig-Euro-Schein ragt.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Sofort bittet er einen aus seiner Truppe, die Leute unter irgendeinem Vorwand vom Sarg wegzudrängen.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Als das erledigt ist und er nach dem Schein greift, packt ihn der Tote plötzlich an der Hand und schreit:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "sluzhivy", "text": "Steuerfahndung! Testbeerdigung!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4, "laugh": "chuckle"}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Du hast deine Arbeit, und ich hab meine.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Und er nagelte den Sargdeckel zu.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-2821b3866f47.ru", "jokeId": "ru-2821b3866f47", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Two-line source kept verbatim; the deadpan coworker is a second puppet since paren has no double.", "title": "Третий день", "location": "ofis", "cast": ["paren", "devushka"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "devushka": "employee"}, "lines": [{"character": "paren", "text": "Третий день не хочется работать, что бы это значило?", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "devushka", "text": "Наверное, сегодня среда.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
