:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "So, have you answered the questions?", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Yes.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Then what are you doing?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Checking.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-439efbf4839a.de", "jokeId": "ru-439efbf4839a", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; the lecturer's thought became his line. Other students are a crowd that leaves. Coin requested.", "title": "Ich prüfe nach", "location": "klass", "cast": ["doktor", "paren"], "roles": {"doktor": "professor", "paren": "student"}, "scenes": [{"location": "klass", "cast": ["doktor", "paren"], "roles": {"doktor": "professor", "paren": "student"}, "looks": {"doktor": {"add": ["glasses"]}}, "crowd": {"who": "people", "size": "few"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "doktor", "to": "teacher-desk"}, {"type": "move", "who": "paren", "to": "student-desk"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "paren", "item": "money", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "crowd", "react": "flee"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "move", "who": "doktor", "to": "center"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}]}], "needs": [{"kind": "prop", "id": "coin", "description": "a single coin held between fingers and flipped", "why": "the student answers and then checks the test by flipping a coin"}], "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Es ist eine Prüfung, ein Test mit Fragen, die man mit Ja oder Nein beantworten muss.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Einer der Studenten wirft eine Münze und schreibt die Ergebnisse auf.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Na, der wird als Erster fertig.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Die Prüfung ist vorbei, die anderen Studenten haben abgegeben und sind gegangen, aber der sitzt immer noch da und wirft seine Münze.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Dem Dozenten reicht es, er geht hin und fragt:", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Na, hast du die Fragen beantwortet?", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Ja.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Und was machst du dann noch?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Ich prüfe nach.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-ed98cbe6a5c3.ru", "jokeId": "ru-ed98cbe6a5c3", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Three source lines kept verbatim; waiter with a bow tie.", "title": "Перепела", "location": "bar", "cast": ["muzhik", "barmen"], "roles": {"muzhik": "customer", "barmen": "waiter"}, "looks": {"barmen": {"add": ["bow-tie"]}}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Официант, можно ещё немного пожарить этих перепелов?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Разве они плохо прожарены?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Я не знаю, но они у меня салат жрут.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
