{"id": "ru-ed98cbe6a5c3.de", "jokeId": "ru-ed98cbe6a5c3", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line.", "title": "Die Wachteln", "location": "bar", "cast": ["muzhik", "barmen"], "roles": {"muzhik": "customer", "barmen": "waiter"}, "looks": {"barmen": {"add": ["bow-tie"]}}, "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Herr Ober, kann man diese Wachteln noch ein bisschen braten?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "barmen", "text": "Sind sie denn nicht richtig durch?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Weiß ich nicht, aber sie fressen meinen Salat.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-aa31b9fcae4f.ru", "jokeId": "ru-aa31b9fcae4f", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Every step of the escalation kept verbatim; 'На следующий день' moved to the narrator, the intro line dropped since the picture shows two friends. Money changes hands on each loan.", "title": "Для ровного счёта", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-sosed": "friend"}, "scenes": [{"location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-sosed": "friend"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "muzhik"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "muzhik"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l11"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "muzhik"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l12"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l13"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l14"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l15"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l16"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "muzhik"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l17"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l18"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l19"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l20"}]}], "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Ах, чёрт, кошелёк забыл, а мне десятки не хватает. Одолжишь?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Ну, держи.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "На следующий день.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Я тебе десятку должен?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Да.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Опять я кошелёк забыл. Одолжи ещё сорок, буду тебе ровно полста должен.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Ну, хорошо.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "На следующий день.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Я тебе пятьдесят рублей должен?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Да.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Опять я сегодня без кошелька. Давай, ты мне ещё сто пятьдесят займёшь, а я уж тебе двести тогда отдам.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Ну, ладно.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "На следующий день.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Я тебе двести должен?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Ну, конечно.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Давай я уж у тебя для ровного счёта ещё триста займу и потом сразу полтыщи отдам.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Ну что ж делать, давай.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "На следующий день.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Я тебе пятьсот должен?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Нет!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-aa31b9fcae4f.en", "jokeId": "ru-aa31b9fcae4f", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line, every step of the escalation kept; roubles became dollars, 'next day' goes to the narrator. Money changes hands on each loan.", "title": "To Round It Off", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-sosed": "friend"}, "scenes": [{"location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-sosed": "friend"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "muzhik"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "muzhik"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l11"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "muzhik"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l12"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l13"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l14"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l15"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l16"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "muzhik"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l17"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l18"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l19"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l20"}]}], "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Oh, damn, I forgot my wallet, and I'm ten dollars short. Lend me ten?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Well, here you go.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "The next day.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Do I owe you ten?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Yes.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "I forgot my wallet again. Lend me another forty, and I'll owe you an even fifty.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Well, all right.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "The next day.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Do I owe you fifty dollars?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Yes.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "No wallet on me again today. Come on, lend me another hundred and fifty, and then I'll pay you back two hundred.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Well, okay.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "The next day.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Do I owe you two hundred?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Well, of course.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Let me borrow another three hundred, just to round it off, and then I'll pay you back five hundred in one go.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Well, what can I do. Here.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "The next day.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Do I owe you five hundred?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "No!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-aa31b9fcae4f.de", "jokeId": "ru-aa31b9fcae4f", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line, every step of the escalation kept; roubles became euros, 'am nächsten Tag' goes to the narrator. Money changes hands on each loan.", "title": "Der runden Summe wegen", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-sosed": "friend"}, "scenes": [{"location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["muzhik", "muzhik-sosed"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "muzhik-sosed": "friend"}, "beats": [{"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "muzhik"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "muzhik"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l11"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "muzhik"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l12"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l13"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l14"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l15"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l16"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik-sosed", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "muzhik"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l17"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l18"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l19"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l20"}]}], "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Ach, verdammt, Geldbeutel vergessen, und mir fehlt ein Zehner. Leihst du mir einen?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Na, hier.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Am nächsten Tag.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Schulde ich dir einen Zehner?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Ja.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Schon wieder hab ich den Geldbeutel vergessen. Leih mir noch vierzig, dann schulde ich dir genau fünfzig.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Na gut.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Am nächsten Tag.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Schulde ich dir fünfzig Euro?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Ja.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Heute schon wieder ohne Geldbeutel. Komm, leih mir noch hundertfünfzig, dann geb ich dir zweihundert zurück.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Na schön.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Am nächsten Tag.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Schulde ich dir zweihundert?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.2}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Na klar.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Komm, der runden Summe wegen leih ich mir noch dreihundert, und dann geb ich dir gleich fünfhundert zurück.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Na, was soll man machen, hier.", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Am nächsten Tag.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Schulde ich dir fünfhundert?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "muzhik-sosed", "text": "Nein!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-9d24f41254be.ru", "jokeId": "ru-9d24f41254be", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Source lines kept verbatim. Phone call cross-cut home / hospital; the young new wife is visible on the sofa so the punchline lands.", "title": "Второй аппендикс", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["devushka", "muzhik"], "roles": {"devushka": "wife", "muzhik": "husband"}, "scenes": [{"location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["devushka", "muzhik"], "roles": {"devushka": "wife", "muzhik": "husband"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "devushka", "to": "sofa"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}]}, {"location": "bolnitsa", "transition": "cut", "cast": ["doktor"], "roles": {"doktor": "doctor"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "doktor", "to": "desk"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "doktor", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}]}, {"location": "gostinaya", "transition": "cut", "cast": ["devushka", "muzhik"], "roles": {"devushka": "wife", "muzhik": "husband"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "devushka", "to": "sofa"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}]}], "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Доктор, умоляю, приезжайте немедленно. У жены сильный приступ аппендицита!", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Не волнуйтесь. Два года назад я сделал вашей жене операцию и удалил слепой отросток. У человека не может появиться второй аппендикс!", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Правильно, доктор. Но у человека может появиться вторая жена.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-9d24f41254be.en", "jokeId": "ru-9d24f41254be", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line. Phone call cross-cut home / hospital; the young new wife is visible on the sofa.", "title": "A Second Appendix", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["devushka", "muzhik"], "roles": {"devushka": "wife", "muzhik": "husband"}, "scenes": [{"location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["devushka", "muzhik"], "roles": {"devushka": "wife", "muzhik": "husband"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "devushka", "to": "sofa"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}]}, {"location": "bolnitsa", "transition": "cut", "cast": ["doktor"], "roles": {"doktor": "doctor"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "doktor", "to": "desk"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "doktor", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}]}, {"location": "gostinaya", "transition": "cut", "cast": ["devushka", "muzhik"], "roles": {"devushka": "wife", "muzhik": "husband"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "devushka", "to": "sofa"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}]}], "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Doctor, I'm begging you, come right away. My wife has a bad attack of appendicitis!", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Don't worry. Two years ago I operated on your wife and removed her appendix. A person can't grow a second appendix!", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "That's right, doctor. But a person can get a second wife.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-9d24f41254be.de", "jokeId": "ru-9d24f41254be", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line. Phone call cross-cut home / hospital; the young new wife is visible on the sofa.", "title": "Der zweite Blinddarm", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["devushka", "muzhik"], "roles": {"devushka": "wife", "muzhik": "husband"}, "scenes": [{"location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["devushka", "muzhik"], "roles": {"devushka": "wife", "muzhik": "husband"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "devushka", "to": "sofa"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}]}, {"location": "bolnitsa", "transition": "cut", "cast": ["doktor"], "roles": {"doktor": "doctor"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "doktor", "to": "desk"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "doktor", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}]}, {"location": "gostinaya", "transition": "cut", "cast": ["devushka", "muzhik"], "roles": {"devushka": "wife", "muzhik": "husband"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "devushka", "to": "sofa"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}]}], "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Herr Doktor, ich flehe Sie an, kommen Sie sofort. Meine Frau hat einen schweren Blinddarmanfall!", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Keine Sorge. Vor zwei Jahren habe ich Ihre Frau operiert und ihr den Blinddarm entfernt. Ein Mensch kann keinen zweiten Blinddarm bekommen!", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Richtig, Herr Doktor. Aber ein Mensch kann eine zweite Frau bekommen.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-3ab9f2fbf6fe.ru", "jokeId": "ru-3ab9f2fbf6fe", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Narration kept, 'А он им' trimmed. Drunk husband crawls in with a red nose; the wife in curlers and both kids run in on the crash.", "title": "Без папки", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["zhena", "devochka", "vovochka", "muzhik"], "roles": {"zhena": "wife", "devochka": "child", "vovochka": "child", "muzhik": "drunk"}, "looks": {"zhena": {"add": ["curlers"]}, "muzhik": {"add": ["red-nose", "tie"]}}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Пьяный муж возвращается домой ползком в три часа ночи.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["muzhik"]}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "В прихожей падает, задевает вешалку, раздаётся страшный грохот и всё рушится — тазы, лыжи, велосипед...", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Из комнаты в ужасе выбегают жена и двое детей.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "enter": ["zhena", "devochka", "vovochka"]}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Ну что, не спится без папки-то?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "ru-3ab9f2fbf6fe.en", "jokeId": "ru-3ab9f2fbf6fe", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line, 'and he says to them' trimmed. Drunk husband with a red nose; the wife in curlers and both kids run in on the crash.", "title": "Without Daddy", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["zhena", "devochka", "vovochka", "muzhik"], "roles": {"zhena": "wife", "devochka": "child", "vovochka": "child", "muzhik": "drunk"}, "looks": {"zhena": {"add": ["curlers"]}, "muzhik": {"add": ["red-nose", "tie"]}}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "A drunk husband crawls home at three in the morning.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["muzhik"]}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "In the hallway he falls, knocks over the coat rack, there's a terrible crash and everything comes down: basins, skis, a bicycle...", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "His wife and two kids run out of the room in horror.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "enter": ["zhena", "devochka", "vovochka"]}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "So what, can't sleep without daddy?", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
